          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Patients receiving estrogen therapy (DES or relocate the bladder neck to an intra-abdominal estriol) should have serial CBC evaluations to position (colposuspension, urethropexy, monitor for bone marrow dyscrasia. prostatopexy, or vas deferensopexy).",
