          "text": "Use all medications at the lowest effective dose.",
          "pdf_page": 1136,
          "printed_page": 1054,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Detrusor relaxation may treat refractory incontinent dogs with an overactive bladder contributing to incontinence or urgency.",
          "pdf_page": 1136,
          "printed_page": 1054,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Medical management for traditional USMI is typically successful in 75–90% of female dogs.",
